jpeg-encoder — Independent JPEG Group license (IJG)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`jpeg-encoder` is licensed `(MIT OR Apache-2.0) AND IJG`. The IJG term is a
conjunctive requirement that cannot be elected away, and it requires the
following notice:

  This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.

Capsule elects MIT for the disjunctive portion.

